  "text": "← My care\nRequest #15\nGet help\nCare story\nRecurring care for Ellie — Applicants\n\nRecurring care\n·\nEleanor Bennett\n·\nRaleigh, NC\n\nOpen for applications\n1\nCare request\n2\nFind caregivers\n3\nReview applicants\n2\n4\nGet started\n\nGET STARTED · REVIEW BEFORE HIRING\n\nCare with Sofia Martinez\n\nOne last look at the care, schedule, and price for Eleanor Bennett.\n\nCare\nRecurring care for Eleanor Bennett\nSchedule\nMon, Wed, Fri · 10:00 AM–12:00 PM\nLocation\n142 Maple Grove Lane, Apartment 2B, Raleigh, NC 27601\nAgreed care\n\nCompanionship, preparing lunch, and light housekeeping.\n\nCompanionship · Meal preparation · Light housekeeping\n\nPlease arrive on time and leave a short update after the visit.\n\nOne arrangement, individual visits.\n\nYour recurring care home keeps the weekly schedule and caregiver together. Open any booked visit there to see its hours, updates, and payment.\n\nFirst visit estimate\n\n2h scheduled · USD\n\nCare · $30.00/hr\n$60.00\nProcessing · $1.00/hr\n$2.00\nEstimated total\n$62.00\n\nBased on scheduled hours and the pricing that applies to this caregiver. Final charges depend on approved hours.\n\nConfirming selects this caregiver, saves the care agreement and prepares card authorization. Other open applications will be marked not selected. Your recurring care home will show booked visits and any payment action needed.\n\nConfirm hire\nBack to caregivers\n\n© 2026 LoLo\n\nLegal links",
